(5809105, 846679, 113649, '<td valign="top">To make a comment on this photograph, the texture on this photo is soft. The snow in the picture is powder and combining the trees with the snow makes the picture not look harsh. The movement in the photo is the clouds, when you look at the picture your eye follows the clouds across the picture. In my opinion, this photo is very pretty and it reminds me of Alta, Wyoming.</td>', 'To make a comment on this photograph, the texture on this photo is soft. The snow in the picture is powder and combining the trees with the snow makes the picture not look harsh. The movement in the photo is the clouds, when you look at the picture your eye follows the clouds across the picture. In my opinion, this photo is very pretty and it reminds me of Alta, Wyoming.', '2010-01-13 08:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
