(5810909, 846251, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s not just the car, or the cinema view that tells me this is yours. It''s the story it tells, past, present...what is, was and could have been and how we still like where we are even though it may not be grand.<br/> <br/>It''s that slice of American life that still gives us hope, like an old memory that makes us smile.</td>', 'It''s not just the car, or the cinema view that tells me this is yours. It''s the story it tells, past, present...what is, was and could have been and how we still like where we are even though it may not be grand. It''s that slice of American life that still gives us hope, like an old memory that makes us smile.', '2010-01-13 22:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
