(5811102, 846498, 49643, '<td valign="top">Hi <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52713" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">scarbrd</a>! She has grown up now &amp; looking more beautiful!<br/>Very nice portrait with beautiful eyes,DOF &amp; natural light! I will like to get her portrait filling the frame :)</td>', 'Hi  scarbrd! She has grown up now & looking more beautiful!Very nice portrait with beautiful eyes,DOF & natural light! I will like to get her portrait filling the frame :)', '2010-01-14 00:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811137, 846143, 49643, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=103142" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vawendy</a>. Excellent timing &amp; focus. I think the colors are not pooping out to my expectation &amp; missing a contrast little bit.</td>', 'I guess it''s from  vawendy. Excellent timing & focus. I think the colors are not pooping out to my expectation & missing a contrast little bit.', '2010-01-14 00:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811139, 846134, 75618, '<td valign="top">The guy who "cheated" in 47 steps? =P <br/> <br/>Like the picture except for the purple halo on the right rock.</td>', 'The guy who "cheated" in 47 steps? =P  Like the picture except for the purple halo on the right rock.', '2010-01-14 00:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811155, 845434, 94241, '<td valign="top">The tendency of my eye in a sunset/sunrise shot is for my eyes to head straight for the background.  But the background here looks a little soft, maybe even out of focus.  It''s not blurred enough to make it look intentional, so there''s a cognitive dissonance where I''m not sure if I''m supposed to pay attention to the foreground or the sunset.  I guess what I''m saying is: I feel a shallower depth of field or a deeper depth of field would either one make this shot stronger, but it''s caught at an awkward point in the middle where I''m not sure what the intention is.</td>', 'The tendency of my eye in a sunset/sunrise shot is for my eyes to head straight for the background.  But the background here looks a little soft, maybe even out of focus.  It''s not blurred enough to make it look intentional, so there''s a cognitive dissonance where I''m not sure if I''m supposed to pay attention to the foreground or the sunset.  I guess what I''m saying is: I feel a shallower depth of field or a deeper depth of field would either one make this shot stronger, but it''s caught at an awkward point in the middle where I''m not sure what the intention is.', '2010-01-14 01:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811156, 846578, 94241, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool shot, I just feel like I''ve seen it a lot of times before.  Sorry.  :(</td>', 'It''s a cool shot, I just feel like I''ve seen it a lot of times before.  Sorry.  :(', '2010-01-14 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811166, 846094, 94241, '<td valign="top">Amazing image, I really like this.<br/> <br/>I think what would make it stronger is to develop the story of the character a bit more.  Okay, he''s at the end of the bridge.  Is he just staring into the water, admiring the scenery?  Or is he distraught and thinking of jumping in?  Maybe making me wonder is your intention, but I feel it would be great to give some more clues.  Like, what if suitcase and umbrella were dropped along the path, and the coat stripped off and discarded?<br/> <br/>Meh, what am I saying, this is a better shot than I could make.  :)</td>', 'Amazing image, I really like this. I think what would make it stronger is to develop the story of the character a bit more.  Okay, he''s at the end of the bridge.  Is he just staring into the water, admiring the scenery?  Or is he distraught and thinking of jumping in?  Maybe making me wonder is your intention, but I feel it would be great to give some more clues.  Like, what if suitcase and umbrella were dropped along the path, and the coat stripped off and discarded? Meh, what am I saying, this is a better shot than I could make.  :)', '2010-01-14 01:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811170, 846176, 94241, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of colorful, but not at all sure I understand it.</td>', 'It''s kind of colorful, but not at all sure I understand it.', '2010-01-14 01:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811177, 846676, 94241, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and outfit.  Her hand position is a bit... crazed?  I think it pulls a little bit of the passion out of her dance.</td>', 'A beautiful model and outfit.  Her hand position is a bit... crazed?  I think it pulls a little bit of the passion out of her dance.', '2010-01-14 01:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811184, 846094, 5034, '<td valign="top">I''ll go out on a limb and say this is Coley, purely from the subject matter.  I like.  Good silhouette, nice drama, good DOF, 8 from me.</td>', 'I''ll go out on a limb and say this is Coley, purely from the subject matter.  I like.  Good silhouette, nice drama, good DOF, 8 from me.', '2010-01-14 01:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811189, 846018, 5034, '<td valign="top">All but Europa.  Attempt no landings there.<br/> <br/>Beautiful.  Exquisite.  If you could have tilted the lens down just a tad to catch all the red reflection it would have been best but that is the only criticism I have.</td>', 'All but Europa.  Attempt no landings there. Beautiful.  Exquisite.  If you could have tilted the lens down just a tad to catch all the red reflection it would have been best but that is the only criticism I have.', '2010-01-14 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
