(5813530, 846650, 111808, '<td valign="top">This frosted collie looks mighty cold but is still quite dignified and patient. I like the off-centre angles of this, it flows.</td>', 'This frosted collie looks mighty cold but is still quite dignified and patient. I like the off-centre angles of this, it flows.', '2010-01-15 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5813554, 846666, 111808, '<td valign="top">The stark black and white tones are perfect for encapsulating the isolated loneliness of this lighthouse on the bluff. It brings out the jagged textures of the rock and gives focus to the clapboard white wood of the building in contrast with the smooth wooden fencing. The sky is lowering and mimics the sea below. This looks old and historic and very well preserved.</td>', 'The stark black and white tones are perfect for encapsulating the isolated loneliness of this lighthouse on the bluff. It brings out the jagged textures of the rock and gives focus to the clapboard white wood of the building in contrast with the smooth wooden fencing. The sky is lowering and mimics the sea below. This looks old and historic and very well preserved.', '2010-01-15 19:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5813562, 846094, 111808, '<td valign="top">Ah, the Umbrella Man is back - although that appendage probably won''t do him much good if he continues forward and steps into the sea. I like this as it is completely surreal ala the style of Magritte. The soft textures of the waves belie the wide expanse of lonely ocean. He gives pause to consider his Journey - and ours. Outstanding!</td>', 'Ah, the Umbrella Man is back - although that appendage probably won''t do him much good if he continues forward and steps into the sea. I like this as it is completely surreal ala the style of Magritte. The soft textures of the waves belie the wide expanse of lonely ocean. He gives pause to consider his Journey - and ours. Outstanding!', '2010-01-15 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5813570, 846066, 111808, '<td valign="top">The crisp white soft snow gives these ruins a quiet sense of winter peace. I like the rillet as the vertical lines echo the distant architecture. The even sky provides a reflective grey illumination to light most of the capture but the woods on the left are dark.</td>', 'The crisp white soft snow gives these ruins a quiet sense of winter peace. I like the rillet as the vertical lines echo the distant architecture. The even sky provides a reflective grey illumination to light most of the capture but the woods on the left are dark.', '2010-01-15 20:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5813573, 846651, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in this odd textured fellow and the golden tree trunk is a great contrast. Superb!</td>', 'Beautiful colours in this odd textured fellow and the golden tree trunk is a great contrast. Superb!', '2010-01-15 20:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5813576, 846700, 111808, '<td valign="top">This captures the unbounded sense of Freedom and Joy found by the wild and domesticated creatures in Nature. The black and white fits this perfectly and the snowy ripples are delightful - kick up your heels and dance!</td>', 'This captures the unbounded sense of Freedom and Joy found by the wild and domesticated creatures in Nature. The black and white fits this perfectly and the snowy ripples are delightful - kick up your heels and dance!', '2010-01-15 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5813585, 846706, 111808, '<td valign="top">Awesome reds and yellows in this beautiful close-up. It reminds me of a natural eye opening and keeping watch over Mortality.</td>', 'Awesome reds and yellows in this beautiful close-up. It reminds me of a natural eye opening and keeping watch over Mortality.', '2010-01-15 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
