(5814228, 846251, 101702, '<td valign="top">Is the car the focal point or the lead in? The reason I ask is that the car leads my eye immediately to the house, which is out of focus. I think either the plane of focus needs swapping so a blurred car leads the eye to the house, or if the car is the subject then that should take up a more prominent position in the composition. All IMO of course, I''m sure others will comment from a directly opposing viewpoint.</td>', 'Is the car the focal point or the lead in? The reason I ask is that the car leads my eye immediately to the house, which is out of focus. I think either the plane of focus needs swapping so a blurred car leads the eye to the house, or if the car is the subject then that should take up a more prominent position in the composition. All IMO of course, I''m sure others will comment from a directly opposing viewpoint.', '2010-01-16 08:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
