(5819725, 845105, 67152, '<td valign="top">Saw you thread.  ''1''s happen all the time, and you need to understand that many different people from very different backgrounds vote on challenges here.   <br/> <br/>Your photo appears to be a bit overexposed, its not completely sharp in focus on the face, and the blade of grass across the front is a bit distracting.  Close up insect shots are very common on DPC these days and those entered need to have WOW to score well.<br/> <br/>While I would not vote this a 1, I don''t think it is one of the better images in the challenge and would likely have voted it a 3 or 4 for the reasons stated above.</td>', 'Saw you thread.  ''1''s happen all the time, and you need to understand that many different people from very different backgrounds vote on challenges here.    Your photo appears to be a bit overexposed, its not completely sharp in focus on the face, and the blade of grass across the front is a bit distracting.  Close up insect shots are very common on DPC these days and those entered need to have WOW to score well. While I would not vote this a 1, I don''t think it is one of the better images in the challenge and would likely have voted it a 3 or 4 for the reasons stated above.', '2010-01-20 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
