(5820181, 846648, 44877, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but had a feeling that this was yours. Capturing that bird in the window is  - of course - the bomb. Beautiful. Great finish, too.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but had a feeling that this was yours. Capturing that bird in the window is  - of course - the bomb. Beautiful. Great finish, too.', '2010-01-20 18:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
