(5820416, 846763, 67697, '<td valign="top">heh - "the border takes away from the photo" - I wonder if he even saw the photo?  I love the rainbow flare.  The globs of snow hanging from the branches is so pretty.  You got skillz man.  :D  Beautiful stuff.</td>', 'heh - "the border takes away from the photo" - I wonder if he even saw the photo?  I love the rainbow flare.  The globs of snow hanging from the branches is so pretty.  You got skillz man.  :D  Beautiful stuff.', '2010-01-20 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
