(5820428, 846700, 67697, '<td valign="top">I would not have guessed this was yours, even tho it has horses lol.  Beautiful scene.  Love the snow spray!</td>', 'I would not have guessed this was yours, even tho it has horses lol.  Beautiful scene.  Love the snow spray!', '2010-01-20 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820434, 846467, 22301, '<td valign="top">I also thought you may be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32767" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pawdrix</a>. I like the interaction and how you converted to black and white.</td>', 'I also thought you may be  pawdrix. I like the interaction and how you converted to black and white.', '2010-01-20 20:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820436, 846348, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really thought this was a cool shot.  I love how you''ve placed yourself into the scene.  The capture of the rain is beautiful.</td>', 'I really thought this was a cool shot.  I love how you''ve placed yourself into the scene.  The capture of the rain is beautiful.', '2010-01-20 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820443, 845190, 100831, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It was one of my highest scoring images in the challenge and I tried hard to guess it''s owner but didn''t come with anything. The tail is terrific.</td>', 'I really like this photo. It was one of my highest scoring images in the challenge and I tried hard to guess it''s owner but didn''t come with anything. The tail is terrific.', '2010-01-20 20:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820444, 846600, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have to say that I do not know your style lol.  I really did not think this was yours.  I was looking for some architecture and play with light and shadow.  Those are your specialties.  It''s an interesting farewell photo - with snow and all.  I like how the snow adds an interesting layer of texture.  And I''m intrigued by the stroller - never seen one like it before.  Look forward to seeing your California pics!</td>', 'I have to say that I do not know your style lol.  I really did not think this was yours.  I was looking for some architecture and play with light and shadow.  Those are your specialties.  It''s an interesting farewell photo - with snow and all.  I like how the snow adds an interesting layer of texture.  And I''m intrigued by the stroller - never seen one like it before.  Look forward to seeing your California pics!', '2010-01-20 20:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820449, 846747, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2010-01-20 20:57:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820451, 846162, 39057, '<td valign="top">While the color, sharpness and DOF are nice it seems to be "missing" something. The angle of the animal takes away from all the otherwise nice aspects. It is almost as if he is laying flat on the picture - if that makes any sense.</td>', 'While the color, sharpness and DOF are nice it seems to be "missing" something. The angle of the animal takes away from all the otherwise nice aspects. It is almost as if he is laying flat on the picture - if that makes any sense.', '2010-01-20 21:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820452, 846650, 39057, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit low but that sort of makes the shot work. The doggie looks cold!</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit low but that sort of makes the shot work. The doggie looks cold!', '2010-01-20 21:02:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820453, 845183, 39057, '<td valign="top">I gave this a six. Very nice. How far were you from the bird?</td>', 'I gave this a six. Very nice. How far were you from the bird?', '2010-01-20 21:03:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820456, 846598, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice motion. Should have scored higher.</td>', 'Nice motion. Should have scored higher.', '2010-01-20 21:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820476, 846653, 98771, '<td valign="top">You do such a wonderful job at capturing these little beauties.</td>', 'You do such a wonderful job at capturing these little beauties.', '2010-01-20 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820515, 846690, 68504, '<td valign="top">Love the moment and freshness of the front boy''s face as he goes his own way - the way I imagine posthumous as a boy.  For some reason.  Maybe to do with your style.  Concentrated but unforced impact.</td>', 'Love the moment and freshness of the front boy''s face as he goes his own way - the way I imagine posthumous as a boy.  For some reason.  Maybe to do with your style.  Concentrated but unforced impact.', '2010-01-20 22:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820516, 846699, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> beautiful haunting shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Don''t I wish! <br/> <br/>Great work, Joe. The rhythm and symmetry play off of one another quite nicely.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous:  bvy beautiful haunting shot.  Don''t I wish!  Great work, Joe. The rhythm and symmetry play off of one another quite nicely.', '2010-01-20 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820517, 846681, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very lovely - excellent example of what can be done with that camera, and I love the use of the 16:9 aspect ratio in vertical.</td>', 'Very lovely - excellent example of what can be done with that camera, and I love the use of the 16:9 aspect ratio in vertical.', '2010-01-20 22:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820519, 846530, 30982, '<td valign="top">Total fail on the mediocre photograph part.  :-)  This is really quite gorgeous!  The fact you didn''t elicit any guesses shows that you have a wide range of capabilities.</td>', 'Total fail on the mediocre photograph part.  :-)  This is really quite gorgeous!  The fact you didn''t elicit any guesses shows that you have a wide range of capabilities.', '2010-01-20 22:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820524, 846502, 68504, '<td valign="top">I might have guessed if I had thought.  But maybe not.  There is something solemsn/sad about it, which is not, I think, your style.  At least I did know that Bassbone''s boys weren''t yours, but say, isn''t it time for yours to pay dpc another visit?</td>', 'I might have guessed if I had thought.  But maybe not.  There is something solemsn/sad about it, which is not, I think, your style.  At least I did know that Bassbone''s boys weren''t yours, but say, isn''t it time for yours to pay dpc another visit?', '2010-01-20 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820527, 846530, 103142, '<td valign="top">I loved this one -- should have commented earlier. Anyway, I gave it an 8. Swans are so difficult, I have yet to be successful with them. This was beyond successful -- beautifully done!</td>', 'I loved this one -- should have commented earlier. Anyway, I gave it an 8. Swans are so difficult, I have yet to be successful with them. This was beyond successful -- beautifully done!', '2010-01-20 22:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
