(5820531, 846762, 103142, '<td valign="top">How incredibly sad! The story adds so much to the photo. It''s like it''s already a dream, fading slowly.</td>', 'How incredibly sad! The story adds so much to the photo. It''s like it''s already a dream, fading slowly.', '2010-01-20 22:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
