(5820539, 846700, 103142, '<td valign="top">I was so sure that you''d be doing horses, but I never remembering a movement shot from you. This is truly spectacular! I gave it a 9. You really need to frame this one and hang it. Absolutely wonderful!</td>', 'I was so sure that you''d be doing horses, but I never remembering a movement shot from you. This is truly spectacular! I gave it a 9. You really need to frame this one and hang it. Absolutely wonderful!', '2010-01-20 22:17:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820547, 846520, 103142, '<td valign="top">The scary thing is, I''m liking more and more of your stuff. Either you''re getting more interesting, or you''re really managing to warp my tastes. :P</td>', 'The scary thing is, I''m liking more and more of your stuff. Either you''re getting more interesting, or you''re really managing to warp my tastes. :P', '2010-01-20 22:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820555, 846274, 103142, '<td valign="top">I do love windows -- they can be so interesting! Fun capture, nicely done. I always look forward to what old you''ll find next; it''s a genre that I really enjoy and you do it so well.</td>', 'I do love windows -- they can be so interesting! Fun capture, nicely done. I always look forward to what old you''ll find next; it''s a genre that I really enjoy and you do it so well.', '2010-01-20 22:21:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5820558, 846672, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the snow on the whiskers. My mother-in-law in Minnesota has horses, and I''ve always wanted to capture a shot like this when they''re all iced or snowed up! Fun shot!</td>', 'I love the snow on the whiskers. My mother-in-law in Minnesota has horses, and I''ve always wanted to capture a shot like this when they''re all iced or snowed up! Fun shot!', '2010-01-20 22:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
