(5820626, 846763, 67579, '<td valign="top">lol Thanks for the comment Michelle, It was one of those mornings I broke away from the city and got deep in to the mountains only to enjoy the sunrise standing in waist deep snow :P</td>', 'lol Thanks for the comment Michelle, It was one of those mornings I broke away from the city and got deep in to the mountains only to enjoy the sunrise standing in waist deep snow :P', '2010-01-20 23:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
