(5821681, 846634, 103048, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a beauty! I wasn''t quite sure what to submit... guess I should''ve taken a leaf from your approach and browsed through my photos (i seem to have clouds cropping up in my pictures quite often)<br/> <br/>Having said that, this is a priceless picture. Well done. I think most of the snow around here (London) is gone, else I''d have loved to try that out. Beauty!</td>', 'Wow, that''s a beauty! I wasn''t quite sure what to submit... guess I should''ve taken a leaf from your approach and browsed through my photos (i seem to have clouds cropping up in my pictures quite often) Having said that, this is a priceless picture. Well done. I think most of the snow around here (London) is gone, else I''d have loved to try that out. Beauty!', '2010-01-21 18:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
