(5866705, 846134, 45475, '<td valign="top">Bit late to the party, but great shot! Have to agree with a few of the comments below - this is better than the 47 steps entry, and the fs for that matter too. I think you had better light and the editing is superb here.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the top 10 finish!</td>', 'Bit late to the party, but great shot! Have to agree with a few of the comments below - this is better than the 47 steps entry, and the fs for that matter too. I think you had better light and the editing is superb here. Congrats on the top 10 finish!', '2010-02-14 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
