(6996263, 846634, 75713, '<td valign="top">I visit this photo when I am homesick - trees like this were a common site making the winter bearable .. now all I see is rain and boring blue skies and a very occasional dramatic sky. I added it to my favorites so I can find it easier .. I have often stared at your work - some of it doesn''t score high and that''s because I don''t think people understand what your stories are about - maybe I don''t either but I like to think so.  I would like to be able to create such shots as you do. Thank you.</td>', 'I visit this photo when I am homesick - trees like this were a common site making the winter bearable .. now all I see is rain and boring blue skies and a very occasional dramatic sky. I added it to my favorites so I can find it easier .. I have often stared at your work - some of it doesn''t score high and that''s because I don''t think people understand what your stories are about - maybe I don''t either but I like to think so.  I would like to be able to create such shots as you do. Thank you.', '2013-03-10 04:44:49.000000', NULL, 0);
